('posts/choose-manufacturer','posts','{"id":"choose-manufacturer","title":"How to choose a custom sportswear manufacturer","cat":"Buying Guides","mins":7,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-09-14","body":"Start with what you are making and how many. A good manufacturer will ask about your sport, your quantities per design and your delivery date before talking price.\n\nAsk for a pre-production sample and compare it against your tech pack. Check fabric weight (GSM), stitching density and print sharpness.\n\nConfirm the minimum order per design and colour, sampling time and bulk lead time in writing. At ORRA these are 50 pieces, 7–10 working days and 27–30 working days."}'::jsonb),
('posts/sublimation-vs-embroidery','posts','{"id":"sublimation-vs-embroidery","title":"Sublimation vs embroidery vs screen printing","cat":"Materials & Printing","mins":6,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-08-22","body":"Sublimation dyes the design into polyester, so there is no limit on colours and nothing cracks or peels.\n\nEmbroidery is stitched thread. It suits crests and logos on polos, jackets and hoodies.\n\nScreen printing lays ink on the surface and is the most economical choice for one or two colours in higher volumes."}'::jsonb),
('posts/moq-sampling-bulk','posts','{"id":"moq-sampling-bulk","title":"MOQ, sampling and bulk production explained","cat":"Manufacturing","mins":5,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-07-30","body":"MOQ is the minimum number of pieces per design and colour. Ours is 50.\n\nSampling takes 7–10 working days once the brief and artwork are confirmed. Bulk starts after sample approval and deposit, and takes 27–30 working days."}'::jsonb),
('posts/fabric-gsm-guide','posts','{"id":"fabric-gsm-guide","title":"Fabric GSM guide for clothing","cat":"Materials & Printing","mins":8,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-06-11","body":"GSM is grams per square metre. Lighter fabrics (120–160) suit jerseys and training tops. Mid weights (180–240) suit polos and tracksuits. Heavier fleeces (300–400) suit hoodies and sweatshirts."}'::jsonb),
('posts/private-label-concept','posts','{"id":"private-label-concept","title":"Private label sportswear: from concept to production","cat":"Private Label","mins":7,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-05-03","body":"Private label means the product carries your brand only. We develop the garment, labels, hangtags and packaging to your guidelines and ship it ready for retail."}'::jsonb),
('posts/teamwear-buyers-guide','posts','{"id":"teamwear-buyers-guide","title":"Custom teamwear manufacturing: a buyer''s guide","cat":"Teamwear","mins":6,"author":"ORRA Production Team","date":"2026-04-18","body":"Plan your full kit together: match jersey, shorts, socks, training top, tracksuit and coaches wear. Producing them as one program keeps colours consistent."}'::jsonb)
